Ola Maps | Ola Maps API Reference > POST /routing/v1/directions

POST /routing/v1/directions
Directions API
Computes an optimal route between two or more locations using Ola Maps' advanced routing engine.  It provides detailed turn-by-turn navigation, step instructions, distance, duration, and real-time traffic congestion insights when requested.

Parameters:

- x-request-id (header, optional): Unique request ID for tracing and logging. {"type": "string"}

- x-correlation-id (header, optional): Correlation ID for distributed tracing across systems. {"type": "string"}

- origin (query, required): Origin coordinates in the format lat,lng. {"type": "string"}

- destination (query, required): Destination coordinates in the format lat,lng. {"type": "string"}

- waypoints (query, optional): Optional waypoints joined by '|' separator in lat,lng format. Up to 25 waypoints. {"type": "string"}

- mode (query, optional): Travel mode - `driving`, `walking`, `bike`, or `auto`. {"type": "string", "default": "driving"}

- alternatives (query, optional): Whether multiple routes should be returned. {"type": "boolean", "default": false}

- steps (query, optional): Whether step-by-step instructions are included. {"type": "boolean", "default": true}

- overview (query, optional): Level of overview geometry - `full`, `simplified`, or `false`. {"type": "string", "default": "full"}

Ola Maps | Directions Basic API - Ola Maps Platform > Sample request with waypoints

```
curl --location --request POST "https://api.olamaps.io/routing/v1/directions/basic?origin=18.76029027465273,73.3814242364375&destination=18.73354223011708,73.44587966939002&waypoints=18.75171540179755%2C%2073.4067693460594&api_key=${your_api_key}" --header "X-Request-Id: XXX"
```

Please refer to the API documentation for further details.

